B.b1r=new A.t("bible","Challenge 940: I burned yet was not consumed; a bush spoke from within me. What am I?","The burning bush")
B.aPa=new A.t("street","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.aWz=new A.t("street","Deep riddle #942 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.aTd=new A.t("street","[Set 31] Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.aY7=new A.t("street","[Set 31] I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I?","Graffiti")
B.aRK=new A.t("street","Challenge 945: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A food truck")
B.aPT=new A.t("church","[Set 31] I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.b1y=new A.t("church","[Set 31] Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.b1K=new A.t("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.aT3=new A.t("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.aYh=new A.t("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.b1B=new A.t("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
B.aUk=new A.t("logic","[Set 31] I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A map")
B.aSo=new A.t("logic","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.aRC=new A.t("logic","Deep riddle #954 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.b_D=new A.t("logic","Challenge 955: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.aP7=new A.t("nature","[Set 31] I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
B.aRP=new A.t("nature","Deep riddle #957 \u2014 I have no lungs yet I hold every breath of the forest. What am I?","A tree")
B.aUZ=new A.t("mystery","[Set 31] I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I?","Your reflection leaving")
B.aW5=new A.t("mystery","[Set 31] Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A habit")
B.aWF=new A.t("wordplay","Challenge 960: What word becomes shorter when you add two letters to it?","Short (adding -er)")
B.aWl=new A.t("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.b1R=new A.t("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.aWw=new A.t("love","[Set 32] Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.b1n=new A.t("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.aZs=new A.t("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.b_m=new A.t("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.aTt=new A.t("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
B.aPF=new A.t("bible","[Set 32] Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I?","Noah's ark")
B.aUs=new A.t("bible","[Set 32] I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
